Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:26.28,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, god, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这样 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 长毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:02:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,图书馆还有更多的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有图书馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a library?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开之前没机会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't get a chance to see it before he bounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃跑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道 我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tell you if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,《旺达·N· 麦金太尔》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vonda N. Mcintyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-this will be satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你弄点吃的 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you something. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 吃什么 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, to eat. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 我想要什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Anything I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃什么都行 你想吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have anything. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能吃龙虾吗 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I have lobster? - No, you can't have lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈以为这是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有罐头意面和番茄酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have canned pasta and tomato sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要橙色的还是红色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want orange-y or red?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,橙色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orange-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有腌黄瓜吗 我爱吃腌黄瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about pickles? I-I like pickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没腌黄瓜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of pickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那薯片呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about potato chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有薯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,42号做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 42 makes them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,42号是这里人的代码系统吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 42 is a coding system for persons here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是工人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the workers, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做的是新鲜薯片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make said chips fresh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他们有个壶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they got a kettle …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我十分钟后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll be back in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受你的新地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:11.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快走）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good mornin', sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你回忆中的一样舒适吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just as cozy as you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你妻子和蒂娜去愚蠢的自驾游之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent a lot of time on the wrong side of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就花了许多时间待在门的错误一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}after that stupid road trip with the wife and Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's talk about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在边界周围花了几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went out looking for your little failed project.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找你的失败项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a few hours, just around the perimeter …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到尾找了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tip to taint, as it were …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我让人把你扔进这里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}right about the time I had you thrown in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I got back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了个\N{\fnArial\fs30}was short…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道些什么吗 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anything about that, Dwighty boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真他妈太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is one hell of a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔走后几小时 她就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}her leaving just a few short hours after Daryl took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本没有靠武力打出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and he didn't force his way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人为他开门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody opened the door for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwighty boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情往反方向发展了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it work the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本该击溃他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to break him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你感化了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he break you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, let's face it …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一些合理的不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got some pretty legitimate grievances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了对我的忠心吗 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You change your stripes on me, Dwighty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始有不同的想法了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You startin' to see things different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前和之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before and after…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 经历了这么多之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, after everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Who are you, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔和你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他要么在回家的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's either on his way home,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么在回这里的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图多杀我们几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try to kill some more of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是杀你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样 我们都会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道雪莉去了哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think you know where Sherry went?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他缝缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stitch him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把能治的地方都治一治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix what you can fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为是她做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think she did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是她做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对她有些了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to know her a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是很了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但足以想明白是怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well enough to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看见达里尔当时的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw Daryl in here, in the state he was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把他放走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被打了一顿扔进牢里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just beaten and thrown in a cell …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说的话很冤\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfairly, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又重整旗鼓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你以后会为他掌管一个哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may wind up running an outpost for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我也懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to think that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种无私 温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The type of selfless, tender soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意嫁给尼根以救自己丈夫一命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would marry Negan to save her husband's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也正是不应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly the kind of person who really isn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,活到现在的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}expected to be around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想帮帮忙而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有大家种植的 制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff people grow, stuff people make,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及搜刮的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff, you know, people scavenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒 面包 剪头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer, bread, cut your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut your what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.19,0:12:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,理发师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能拯救一下你头上那坨东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be able to kill that thing on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用的是工分系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use a points system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是我们中的一员了 和他们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of us now, not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们伙食糟糕 我们吃香喝辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}They eat shit, we eat good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,写下你拿了什么 或者让他们做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write what you took or what they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后写上对应的点数 再签个名\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much it was worth, sign your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一定是你的幸运日 长毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be your lucky day, haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是自家做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these homemade?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不错的手工腌菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some good DIY stuff there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No … no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿什么 长毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take it, haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让西蒙过去看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send Simon over to take a peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先来软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sort of good-cop this thing first,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有什么效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}see how far we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全场焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man of the hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on over here, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么没礼貌 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be rude, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「你好」啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…好\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-h-hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有名字吗 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a name, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Eugene…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还记得露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you remember Lucille.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见这里这个东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you see this right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能得靠近点仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have to get real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 那是你造的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, is the bullet you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在正常情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, under normal circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一遍又一遍地让你亲密接触它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be showing you that real close over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 尤金 你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Eugene, see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道你是不是个机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}all I really want to know is if you are a smarty-pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的很多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我确实挺机灵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I am, indeed, a smarty-pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…自学了造子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…taught myself to cast bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…找到了一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…found a …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了一个机械车间\N{\fnArial\fs30}found a machine shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有必需的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the necessary…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读了很多书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I read a lot, and, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}although my …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我做不到过目不忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though my memory is not considered eidetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也不会走马观花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't skim and I don't scrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如书上有什么知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}If knowledge is dropped,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.32,0:15:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实会学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, indeed, pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的只是个混蛋而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you really are just some asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好几个生物化学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have PHDs in biochemistry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有免疫学与微生物学博士学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as immunology and microbiology,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成了博士学位 所以是货真价实的博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've completed my doctorate, which makes me a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prior to the collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人类基因组计划十人小组的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was part of a 10-person team at the human genome project,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,受布鲁克斯·埃利斯博士领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}working under Dr. T. Brooks Ellis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,研制对抗病毒武器的病毒武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}to weaponize diseases to fight weaponized diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以毒…攻毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire with, uh… You know…fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同部门间喝过酒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see, interdepartmental drinks were …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 机灵鬼博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Dr. Smarty-pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该能不费吹灰之力解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to be able to crack this without breaking a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 围栏边我有很多免费劳工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I have a lot of free labor here at the fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,活死人可以防止其他杂碎进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}living dead pricks that help keep the riffraff out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.19,0:16:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是它们站不住 总是会散架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is, they don't keep. They fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那摊可怜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that poor sack of…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}pile of shit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 机灵鬼博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dr. Smarty-Pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么才能让他们站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we keep them on their feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常冶炼 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}smelt on the regs, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一堆遗留设备当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that among the legacy equipment on the floor that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有可运作的熔炉 - 是又怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you possess an operational smelter. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经掌握了解决问题的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already possess the means to resolve your issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一步 熔化金属废料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step one, melt down scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二步 铁链拴住行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step two, pour it over the compromised walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把金属液浇到它们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they are in contact with the chain link.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,液态金属会变硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The liquid metal will harden…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,既可以保持行尸身体完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both maintaining bodily integrity for the walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又可以把它们粘在围栏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as affixing them to the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,更棒的是遮盖了它们的头部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonus points for covering their head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:18:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止敌人攻击或意外发生导致脑袋碎裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protecting them from head trauma from hostiles and calamities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子听过的最酷的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that ain't the coolest thing I've ever heard in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不但可行 而且霸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only is that practical, it is just bad-ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 机灵鬼博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, Dr. Smarty-pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克有没有让你替他做这些有意义的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Rick have you doing this kind of valuable stuff for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他亏了 我们赚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His loss, our gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该给你签约奖金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I need to give you some kind of signing bonus here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经得到了腌黄瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, w-well, I wa… I was gifted these pickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为对你的答谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a token of my gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要送我的老婆们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna send you over a few of my wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:19:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你房间去 让你乐一乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your apartment tonight, show you a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不用担心这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't think I have to worry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁又知道你到底有多聪明呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who knows how truly smart you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是禁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a grave no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以吃顿惬意的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, you can have a little dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝喝小酒 乐呵乐呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}some drinks, share a few laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么比漂亮妞的体香\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing like beautiful women that smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更让你觉得自己又像个人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make you feel human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这方面我完全不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说「老婆们」 是指有很多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-d-did you say "Wives", meaning plural?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,机灵鬼博士要对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does Dr. Smarty-pants say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在世界上最好的新朋友说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his new bestest friend in the whole wide world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常地 完全地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully, completely…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诚心地 认真地感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sincerely, seriously…Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找点乐子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go have some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I even looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似小虫子的生物叫亚尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The insect-like creature is called Yar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们试图报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is attempting to exact revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔昆塔 因为它摧毁了拉扎克四\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the evil Qotile for the destruction of Razak IV.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该放松点 安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should take it easy, Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我不应该 弗兰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I shouldn't, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以玩点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we could play something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以四个人玩 很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's four-player and quite the hoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚为你服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想来个按摩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan loves them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认证按摩师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was a licensed therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I appreciate the gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你对分配对象的认真精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your commitment to your assigned objective,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常清楚今晚你们没有一位是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fully aware that none of you ladies are here this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于自愿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子游戏是我唯一可以展示给你们的乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Video games are all about me showing all of you a fun time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想再吃点微波炉爆米花吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care for more microwave popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这是尼根的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just because this was Negan's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不意味着我们不愿意来\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean that we don't want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有理性谈话 我就愿意来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be down with just having an intelligent conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在目前的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose a conversation would be acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话是可以接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the current circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类基因组计划怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, how about the human genome project?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以聊一整晚这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could talk about that shit all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在人类基因组计划中的主要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bulk of my work for the HGP.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.53,0:22:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于黑盒子项目的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}fell under the auspices of the black box program,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我无权谈论此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of which I am not at liberty to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all likelihood, even if I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也很可能无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd probably escape your comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚侮辱了我们吗 塔尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just insult us, Tanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.59,0:22:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是侮辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not a dis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是陈述事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was simply a statement of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的智商经历了客观测量\N{\fnArial\fs30}My intelligence has been objectively measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个鹤立鸡群的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fully a man apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, are you, like, one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用漂白剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can make a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和牙签什么的做炸弹的人咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of bleach and a toothpick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那至少需要干酵母 过氧化氢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would at least require dry yeast, hydrogen peroxide,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,少量洗洁精\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a small amount of liquid dish soap,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还要一些洁厕灵或者通渠剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe some, you know, bathroom or drain cleaner,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些气球之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}some balloons or something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加一些常见的生活用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}few other common household sundries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious as sepsis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.55,0:23:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这能表现我的聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping to illustrate the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是奴隶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.73,0:23:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金博士 你刚用厕所里的东西制造了氦气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Eugene, did you just make helium out of toilet stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是氢气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydrogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 基诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, Keno.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.45,0:23:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.21,0:23:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们中的一员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该提前说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should disclose in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将其归类为炸弹也许是有点说大话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have oversold this one by classifying it as a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过氧化氢分解时\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the hydrogen peroxide decomposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一反应会以放热的形式释放能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reaction will release energy in the form of heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金博士 你能给我们看点精彩的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Eugene, can you please just show us some good shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.27,0:24:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要点燃这根蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna light this candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真酷 - 终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cool! - Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 我要点燃这根蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, I'm gonna light this candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.68,0:25:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,D 我们总是说如果我们分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}D … we always said that if we got separated,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该回到这里等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should come back here and wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.86,0:26:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会带着啤酒和椒盐脆饼出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd show up with beer and pretzels.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.44,0:26:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.17,0:26:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总说我们开始约会时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always said that when we started dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记告诉我你记性很差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you forgot to tell me you had a shitty memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.99,0:26:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前会因此很沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to get so frustrated by it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.65,0:26:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你不会记得那些好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing you wouldn't remember those good days…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}those special days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.95,0:26:36.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喂金鱼 爱你的雪莉 快走）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.54,0:26:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有许多想记住的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was so much you wanted to hold on to,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.76,0:26:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你就这样忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it'd be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.01,0:26:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你很幸运你记性不好 D\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're lucky you don't remember things, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.62,0:27:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我现在能等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could wait for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道你会跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know if you'd come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.63,0:27:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是带我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if you'd take me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you'd kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.55,0:27:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想活在那个世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want to live in that world,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我逼你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那样做是因为我不想让你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I did because I didn't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.27,0:27:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you've killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了你不想成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've become everything you didn't want to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.07,0:27:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.55,0:27:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.78,0:27:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.83,0:27:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放达里尔走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Daryl go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他让你想起了以前的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he reminded you of who you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.14,0:27:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我想让你忘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted to let you forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.47,0:27:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得自己能在外面活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I'm gonna make it out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.85,0:28:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里并不比死了更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being there isn't better than being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.04,0:28:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you realize that,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.13,0:28:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能离开那\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hope you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.52,0:28:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你记得那些美好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you remember the good days,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只记得一点 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}even just one of them, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.21,0:28:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你会想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.91,0:28:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许根本不会读到这封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you'll ever read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱以前的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我让你变成了现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I made you into who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.85,0:28:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.21,0:28:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.98,0:29:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到你在玩亚尔和昆塔了 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hear the Yars and the Qotile, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.47,0:29:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的理解里 昨晚的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was given to understand that last night's shinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是单一偶发事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}was supposed to be a singular incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.35,0:29:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他叫我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't send us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.54,0:29:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你看到安珀的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw Amber last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.97,0:29:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了哭 哭了喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just drinks and cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.49,0:30:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.10,0:30:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We signed up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.22,0:30:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是被迫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妈妈需要药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her mom needed meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又不能干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀本以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.62,0:30:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she could live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.63,0:30:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.61,0:30:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她求我们帮她结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked us to help her end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.41,0:30:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有可做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't afforded any…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.70,0:30:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理健康辅导吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}mental-health services?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.82,0:30:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是认真的吗 - 你们有认证女按摩师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - I mean, there's a licensed masseuse here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.15,0:30:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,按概率来说 应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, odds being what they are …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one like that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.98,0:30:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this…is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是想吃点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just wants to take something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.41,0:31:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡过去 再不醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to go to sleep and not wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.67,0:31:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样非常不负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be wildly irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在睡梦中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She dies at night, in her sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.05,0:31:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成行尸的时候 其他人都在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}she turns while everyone is asleep…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们负责处理那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.86,0:31:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你能帮她做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping that you could make something for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.07,0:31:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们知道你会做东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we know that you can make things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.32,0:31:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很疯狂 你也不怎么了解我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that this is crazy and you barely know us…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.74,0:31:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们知道你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can tell that you are a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好人不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't many of those left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.12,0:31:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth of the matter is, I'm not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不守序 不中立 不叛逆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lawful, neutral, or chaotic …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.28,0:31:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,以上都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the above.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.82,0:31:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你做不了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying you can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.49,0:31:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是能力缺失的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lack of ability is not the problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.59,0:32:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用现有的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could jerry-rig a lethal toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.41,0:32:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,随意提取出某种致命毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the assets at hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 我是… - 那就帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No problemo. I have the … - Then help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.88,0:32:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片药 一小杯药水 都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pill, a shot, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.15,0:32:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要两份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.27,0:32:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们不知道什么时候才有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we don't know when we could get our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.58,0:32:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们帮不帮她 她都要寻死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna do it, with or without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.17,0:32:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会很痛苦 或者导致其他人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll suffer, and maybe someone else will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是好人 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are good, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.94,0:32:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.27,0:32:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much does she weigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.83,0:32:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 一百二吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Maybe…120.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.10,0:32:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.31,0:32:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们能告诉我她的准确体重\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could get me her exact weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证做出半精加工无痛毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could guarantee a semi-precise t.O. Pain-free d.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.12,0:32:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快做出\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.87,0:33:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best I can do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.24,0:33:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点再来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.17,0:33:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几个人玩扑克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're playing poker with some guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.63,0:33:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着帮你牵线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to hook you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.95,0:33:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗 玩不了扑克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding? Can't play poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.19,0:33:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上天一亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to be out diggin' postholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.57,0:33:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就得出去挖坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the crack of dawn tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.79,0:33:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一板铝塑包装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like a single blister pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.00,0:33:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强效的感冒胶囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your most extra-strength cold capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.38,0:33:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,队是用来排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The line's a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你老家都不排队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they not have them where you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么排吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how they work?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.38,0:33:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我熟悉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am familiar …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.40,0:33:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面排着去 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in it, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.09,0:34:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的编号是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,16\N{\fnArial\fs30}16.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.51,0:34:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 16号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, number 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.72,0:34:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尤金·波特博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dr. Eugene Porter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.45,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近被赋予了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've recently been appointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里新设立的首席工程师之职\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the newly created post of chief engineer of this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.23,0:34:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直属尼根管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I report directly to Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.38,0:34:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你直属我管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you report directly to my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.85,0:34:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感冒胶囊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cold capsules, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.89,0:34:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 来的新人很多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just … we get so many new faces, I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.21,0:35:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我也要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.52,0:35:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.46,0:35:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你管这叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what you call this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.74,0:35:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要叫它小黏糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call it a gremblygunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.94,0:35:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.02,0:35:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.99,0:35:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逃向了一群行尸中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran away from me right into a mess of dead ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.77,0:35:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我…给了她痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I, uh… Made it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.01,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.25,0:36:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有绷带好一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels better with a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.57,0:36:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想告诉你忘了她 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would tell you to just forget about her, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.16,0:36:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到她做的事情 我不觉得短时间内\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I don't see anyone else doing that anytime soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.28,0:36:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都做过一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we've all done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但在我们来这里之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but before we got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.11,0:36:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们懂得之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we understood…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.41,0:36:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were cowards about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.37,0:36:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…不能留有善良之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't … we don't get to have big hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.70,0:36:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.43,0:36:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh-what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.49,0:36:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好睁眼好好看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna want to pay close attention to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.68,0:37:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.42,0:37:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.52,0:37:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现这个小纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this little souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在你的桌子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}tucked away in your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.05,0:38:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.42,0:38:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门放走了我的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}left the door open and let my puppy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.10,0:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道雪莉不喜欢达里尔在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Sherry hated Daryl being here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.24,0:38:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你为她放了他 趁机逞英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you let him out for her, be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.19,0:38:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就可以插一脚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you could move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.97,0:38:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.65,0:38:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}is some weaselly shit right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.07,0:38:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没这么做 是她自己逃跑的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't. She's the one who ran …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.12,0:38:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.32,0:38:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么她会逃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why she ran?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她知道我会怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she knew I would blame her, which…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.70,0:39:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.87,0:39:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是雪莉在她被撕碎之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see, Sherry told Dwighty boy the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉了小德整件事的经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}right before she was torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.61,0:39:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个超级辣妹 因为你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A super hot girl, horrifically killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.78,0:39:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,痴心妄想和小鸡鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of your greedy, delusional,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.48,0:39:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,被残忍杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tiny little prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not true. Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.30,0:39:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.67,0:39:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我决不会这么做 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would never do that. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.83,0:39:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么他要撒谎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.59,0:39:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他要故意伤害你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he intentionally try to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.26,0:39:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪莉死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherry's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's lying…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着 我会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's out there, I will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.57,0:39:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会烧了他另外半张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I will burn the other side of his face off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.89,0:39:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能从中得到什么好处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was he gonna get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.08,0:39:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.50,0:39:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.29,0:39:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解我的小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I know my Dwighty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.11,0:39:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要的只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, all he needed…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在牢房里再被关一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}was one more night in the hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.19,0:39:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后脑子就正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}get his head screwed on straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.91,0:40:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前管用 现在也管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked before, and it worked now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是啊 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.01,0:40:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.88,0:40:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.48,0:40:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.17,0:40:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不要烫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jesus, don't burn me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.52,0:40:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.72,0:40:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.27,0:40:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.59,0:40:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.24,0:40:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我讨厌这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know I hate this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.24,0:40:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用告诉我是你做的 你很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me you did it and that you're sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.34,0:40:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不用动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.81,0:40:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.25,0:40:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做的 都是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did it … all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.99,0:40:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.87,0:40:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.19,0:40:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.17,0:41:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.59,0:41:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all you had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.75,0:41:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我们还有个卡森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good thing we got a spare Dr. Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.70,0:41:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you, Dwighty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.61,0:42:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不该怀疑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never shoulda doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.16,0:42:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪莉是我最喜欢的女人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherry was one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.49,0:42:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.39,0:42:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.81,0:42:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice-cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.87,0:42:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.96,0:42:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.03,0:42:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.73,0:42:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.85,0:42:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.41,0:42:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以下局玩 不过要等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call next, but it might be a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.58,0:43:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you make the pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.28,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.43,0:43:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.08,0:43:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀指望着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber's counting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.31,0:43:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟她说你会帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We told her that you were gonna help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.95,0:43:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说她… - 住嘴 红发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and she says that she … - Pump your brakes, red.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.93,0:43:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别侮辱我的智商 弗兰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not insult my intelligence, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,药不是给安珀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said pills aren't for Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.06,0:43:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,药是给尼根的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said pills are for Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.75,0:43:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要两份\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you wanted two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.27,0:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是杀了你的朋友们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't he kill your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.19,0:43:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了好几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.02,0:43:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们也杀了他的三十多个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I imagine we killed about 30 or so of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.46,0:43:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turnabout and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.99,0:43:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们药 不然我们向尼根告状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the pills, or we'll tell Negan about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.80,0:43:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会说做药是你的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tell him that it was your idea to make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.86,0:43:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试图劝我们协助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you tried to get us to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.79,0:43:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是你的战术错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be a tactical error on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.21,0:43:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会信我而不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll believe me over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.44,0:43:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如他信德怀特而不是医生一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the same reason he believed Dwight over the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.06,0:43:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他来说是可取代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're replaceable to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.22,0:44:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一方面 我则不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, on the other hand, am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.50,0:44:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.37,0:44:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个…懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.11,0:44:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是正确的评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a correct assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.40,0:45:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.70,0:45:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how you liking it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.76,0:45:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把机灵鬼博士招待得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we doing right by Dr. Smarty-pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.59,0:45:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰基和塔尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Frankie and Tanya…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.01,0:45:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们说的都是你的好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but good things to say about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.79,0:45:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.12,0:45:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.04,0:46:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道接受改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how hard it can be to accept change,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.83,0:46:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃暗投明有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get on the right team.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.67,0:46:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我需要你明白一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.06,0:46:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会随意邀请他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not make this invitation to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.31,0:46:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的邀请分量也很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I sure as shit do not make it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.18,0:46:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用再害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not need to be scared anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.82,0:46:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.69,0:46:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用回答我一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to answer me one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.28,0:46:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.48,0:46:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are …
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.66,0:46:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.54,0:46:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完完全全 彻头彻尾是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm utterly, completely, stone-cold Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.24,0:46:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见你之前我就是尼根了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Negan before I even met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.74,0:46:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见你之后 我才醒悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just needed to meet you properly to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.73,0:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.75,0:47:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, be careful with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.78,0:47:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想被熔态金属烫到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to get burned by molten metal?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.70,0:47:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那样做会被熔态金属烫到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that's exactly how you get burned by molten metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.11,0:47:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我施压…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regarding me clamping down …
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.27,0:47:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们一伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.67,0:47:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.93,0:47:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道你是否记得我名字 - 不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know if you recall my handle … I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.90,0:47:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.60,0:48:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.05,0:48:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
